ree and a half  trillion dollars that they are proposing  and at this point you know it's the  democrats responsibility they're doing  the spending they're running everything  in a partisan way it's their job to get  this done to that three and a half  trillion dollar spending and tax package  what are your concerns about the taxes  included in that massive spending bill  yeah so i most americans think this  country is on the wrong track and this  is going to make it worse it will kill  american jobs drive prices up even  higher on families and i think hook a  whole new generation the poor on the  government dependency first this is an  economic surrender to uh china russia in  europe that will drive american jobs  overseas and could kill up to three  million american jobs over time  it is devastating tax hikes on main  street small businesses just as they're  trying to come out of the covet plus  they double the death tax the number of  family-owned businesses and farms  that'll be hit by the death tax and then  finally president biden clearly  breaks his pledge by raising taxes on  low-income and middle-class families  don't take my word for that both the  joint committee on taxation and the  left-leaning tax policy center say those  tax increases on the middle class could  start as early as next year fascinating  congressman kevin brady of the great  state of texas thanks so much for your  time sir good to see you mike thanks  thank you
 

